session:pr699Summary a agp:TranscriptSummary ;
    agp:summaryText "Final sub-issue of epic #564: wired owl_xml_parser's .owx/.owl parsing into the CLI (load_file/apply_ontologies) and dagalog-kernel notebook (%%owlxml magic), mirroring #633's .ofn wiring exactly. The real design decision was disambiguating .owl, since this repo's own test fixtures already use that extension for plain Turtle: added owl_xml_parser::looks_like_owl_xml, which sniffs whether the document's XML root element is <Ontology> before treating a .owl file as OWL/XML rather than assuming by extension alone, with a regression test pinning that existing Turtle .owl fixtures still load as Turtle. Issue #608 (ABox axiom parsing) was still open when this started, so this PR is TBox-only for now by construction -- confirmed owl_xml_parser hard-errors (not silently drops) on ABox constructs like <ClassAssertion>, so full ABox support will appear automatically once #608 merges and this lands, with no further CLI-side change needed. A real CI-only failure (rustdoc::private_intra_doc_links on two doc comments referencing the private frame_ontology_ext helper) was caught, root-caused by reproducing the exact CI docs command locally, and fixed by downgrading the references from markdown links to plain code spans." ;
    agp:reasoningFor ghpull:699 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy session:pr699 ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo session:claudeSonnet5 .

